 know that you do not have the ability to manage caring for it</p></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-dd3cb16" data-id="dd3cb16" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-96ee2b0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="96ee2b0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p>These captivating, and low-maintenance water features panels have mesmerizing dancing bubbles inside that flow and change, creating an ever-moving work of art that is the perfect focal point for your facility.</p><p>With the help of Midwest Tropical, you can have a custom Water Panel™ bubble wall fountain for sale that will dress up your space and make it look more inviting and attractive.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b2f1c3b elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="b2f1c3b" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-87da614" data-id="87da614" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e76b9ca elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="e76b9ca" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img decoding="async" width="2560" height="1389" src="/wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-Homewood-SUites-Orlando-FLorida-1-jpg.avif" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-100770" alt="Vertical Chamber Bubble Wall Homewood SUites Orlando FLorida 1 jpg" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-Homewood-SUites-Orlando-FLorida-1-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-Homewood-SUites-Orlando-FLorida-1-jpg-768x417.avif 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-Homewood-SUites-Orlando-FLorida-1-jpg-800x434.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-Homewood-SUites-Orlando-FLorida-1-jpg-1440x781.avif 1440w, /wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-Homewood-SUites-Orlando-FLorida-1-jpg.avif 2560w" sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" title="Bubble Walls 1"></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f7eada4" data-id="f7eada4" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2257834 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2257834" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h2>Custom Fully Enclosed Bubble Walls Panel Systems For Sale</h2><p>Midwest Tropical offers custom-built, fully enclosed LED bubble wall systems that require minimal maintenance to offer a beautiful water feature to your home or commercial space. These custom bubble walls panels can include LED lighting, shaped glass and other features to make each one a unique piece of art and a true statement for your space. The bubbles trapped inside the acrylic panels will dance and flow, creating movement and adding life to your space, all without undue maintenance.</p><p>Because Midwest Tropical makes these in-house bubble wall fountain including everything from the initial design to the final installation handled by our experienced team you can have something that fits your imagination perfectly. We have designed, built and installed bubble water walls of all sizes including designs that were more than 100 feet long, with curved or serpentine structures, and measuring up to 30 feet high. In reality, with the help of our highly skilled team, your customized Water Panel™ is only limited by your imagination.</p><p>Midwest Tropical is the largest source for custom designed Bubble Wall panels and LED bubble walls for sale. Our expert team is highly capable of designing bubble walls at custom requirements to fit any space of any size. Our exquisite range of LED bubble walls for sale can be found in a variety of vibrant colors, spectacular lighting and eye-catching features that can all be controlled via a feature rich remote control. We are committed to provide our customers with excellent quality and hence we use only the best type of acrylic, air pumps, valves and hoses in all of our products. The built-quality and mesmerizing view of our bubble wall panels creates a welcoming impression on visitors at first sight. We have a dedicated team that assures unique art work on each piece of our bubble wall and every product is completely unique in its own way. Either you choose a wall standing or a wall handing design our designs require minimal maintenance with very low energy consumption.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-38d1f88 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="38d1f88" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-168ff46" data-id="168ff46" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a55ff41 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="a55ff41" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h2>Perfect Settings for Adding a Bubble Wall Art</h2><p>If you’re wondering if your space is the right setting for one of these beautiful features, odds are, it is. Thanks to the soothing ambiance these bubble water features offer, they work beautifully in all kinds of environments.</p><p>A few examples include:</p><ul><li>Casinos</li><li>Offices</li><li>Hotels and resorts</li><li>Spas</li><li>Office complexes</li><li>Conference centers</li><li>Restaurants</li><li>Medical centers</li></ul><p>Any setting where you’re looking for a way to create a more calming, comfortable mood, a bubble wall art panel can help. Add one to a high-traffic area and counterbalance the noise. Use one in a spa environment to enhance its sense of luxury. These eye-catching bubble water fountains enhance any setting!</p><h3>Types of Bubble Walls Fountains</h3><p>There’s no limit to the styles and designs Midwest Tropical offers, especially because we can custom-make new types to suit you. Whether you’re interested in a swirly design that sends twisting bubbles through the wall or a bubble column shaped like an upright pillar, we can help.</p><p>Here are some examples of the design types we offer:</p><ul><li><a href="/bubble-walls/custom-bubble-walls/">Custom</a></li><li><a href="/swirly-bubble-walls/">Swirly</a></li><li><a href="/vertical-chamber-bubble-walls/">Vertical chamber</a></li><li>Bubble columns</li><li><a href="/stock-bubble-walls/">Stock</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f4e7cf7" data-id="f4e7cf7" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-787fd6e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="787fd6e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default"><img decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" width="1344" height="653" src="/wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-with-DMX-Lighting-at-Olathe-Public-Library-2-1-jpg.avif" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-100762" alt="Vertical Chamber Bubble Wall with DMX Lighting at Olathe Public Library 2" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-with-DMX-Lighting-at-Olathe-Public-Library-2-1-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-with-DMX-Lighting-at-Olathe-Public-Library-2-1-jpg-768x373.avif 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-with-DMX-Lighting-at-Olathe-Public-Library-2-1-jpg-800x389.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-with-DMX-Lighting-at-Olathe-Public-Library-2-1-jpg.avif 1344w" sizes="(max-width: 1344px) 100vw, 1344px" title="Bubble Walls 2"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ce6cfb9 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="ce6cfb9" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d861f06" data-id="d861f06" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0f47206 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="0f47206" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h2 style="text-align: center;">Why Choose Midwest Tropical for Your Bubble Wall?</h2></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a4d041e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="a4d041e" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-31d5f73" data-id="31d5f73" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fd364dc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="fd364dc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p>Midwest Tropical pioneered the idea of the water wall — and we’re still the company that understands water features best. While many competitors have emerged since we launched the concept in the 1970s, we remain the leader with the most experience and the best creative options. Our proprietary sealed design eliminates any regular maintenance and utilizes a special closed-loop pump system to stop water evaporation. We also make everything at our facility, and even have an in-house design team, so you can trust that your final product will fit perfectly. We install our designs throughout the United States and the world, but everything is made right here in America. This means you can trust Midwest Tropical for quality, creativity and beauty.</p><p>Midwest Tropical offers several high-tech effects which includes variable air release, custom controls that creates a unique synchronization between the water bubbles and LED.</p></div><section class="elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-52fb8a2 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="52fb8a2" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-623f5c7" data-id="623f5c7" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1b2cba1 elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="1b2cba1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default"><a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="/request-a-quote/"><span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper"><span class="elementor-button-text">Get A Free Quote</span></span></a></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4da5ca0" data-id="4da5ca0" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4a2cf20 elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="4a2cf20" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default"><a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="/contact-us/"><span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper"><span class="elementor-button-text">Contact Us Today!</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></section><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a3b3484 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="a3b3484" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p>Whether you’re looking for something intricate like a Water Panel™ bubble wall with LED lighting, or something simpler, like a quiet fountain for a corner of your building, <a href="/contact-us/">contact Midwest Tropical</a>. Let us provide you with a <a href="/request-a-quote/">free quote,</a> and you can see how easily you can add the ambiance and beauty of a custom water feature to your facility. <a href="/contact-us/">Contact us today!</a></p></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b4bf6a0" data-id="b4bf6a0" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d4f5b5a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d4f5b5a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p><strong>How We Breathe Magic into Our Water Bubble Panels<br /></strong>Being the pioneers in the indoor water feature industry, Midwest Tropical is known for its quality, creativity, and beauty. Boasting an unrivaled experience of 5 decades, Midwest’s innovative in-house manufacturing and assembly practices coupled with the most experienced workforce promises a water feature experience that transcends beyond average. Here are the components of a bubble wall prototype and how Midwest Tropical’s quality practices, extensive research, and market experience of more than 40 years form a custom enclosed bubble wall experience like none other:</p><p><strong>The bubble wall core – Acrylic Tanks<br /></strong>Experimenting through the 5 decades of bubble wall innovation, Midwest creates its bubble walls panels from 100% acrylic sheets, weighing a fraction of glass, providing durability, strength, and UV resistance lasting for decades to come. Our ongoing research on the subject has allowed us to create the finest, safest bubble walls than available anywhere else in the market.</p><p><strong>The bubble wall breather – Bubble Aerator<br /></strong>Giving bubble wall its majestic splendor, we create long-lasting aerators that are corrosion-resistant and can be easily maintained or replaced, allowing your water feature to last for a lifetime.</p><p><strong>The bubble wall charm – LED Lighting<br /></strong>Evolving with the most modern technology trends of each decade, we have innovated our bubble walls with high performance, low voltage, and extremely efficient LED lighting to couple soothing effects with some spectacular visual sensory input.</p><p><strong>Midwest’s Bubble Walls – As Spectacular as Functional<br /></strong>Being the pioneers of the ‘indoor water feature concept,’ every bubble wall for sale created by Midwest Tropical had the ability to tap into creating a soothing environment wherever it’s placed.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-475748d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="475748d" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-dd525e0" data-id="dd525e0" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b14cbfe elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b14cbfe" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h3><strong>Frequently Asked Questions – FAQs.</strong></h3></div><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7042231 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="7042231" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
 <style>.accordion .accordion-item{border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5}.accordion .accordion-item button[aria-expanded=true]{border-bottom:1px solid #03b5d2}.accordion button{position:relative;display:block;text-align:left;width:100%;padding:1em 0;color:#7288a2;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:400;border:none;background:none;outline:none}.accordion button:hover,.accordion button:focus{cursor:pointer;color:#03b5d2}.accordion button:hover::after,.accordion button:focus::after{cursor:pointer;color:#03b5d2;border:1px solid #03b5d2}.accordion button .accordion-title{padding:1em 1.5em 1em 0}.accordion button .icon{display:inline-block;position:absolute;top:18px;right:0;width:22px;height:22px;border:1px solid;border-radius:22px}.accordion button .icon::before{display:block;position:absolute;content:"";top:9px;left:5px;width:10px;height:2px;background:currentColor}.accordion button .icon::after{display:block;position:absolute;content:"";top:5px;left:9px;width:2px;height:10px;background:currentColor}.accordion button[aria-expanded=true]{color:#03b5d2}.accordion button[aria-expanded=true] .icon::after{width:0}.accordion button[aria-expanded=true] + .accordion-content{opacity:1;max-height:9em;transition:all 200ms linear;will-change:opacity,max-height}.accordion .accordion-content{opacity:0;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:opacity 200ms linear,max-height 200ms linear;will-change:opacity,max-height}.accordion .accordion-content p{font-size:1rem;font-weight:300;margin:2em 0}</style>
<div class="accordion"><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-1" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">What is a bubble wall, and how does it work?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>A bubble wall is a decorative feature where air bubbles rise through a panel of water, creating a dynamic visual effect. It works by pumping air through the water to produce bubbles. If you are looking for a custom bubble wall, contact us at Midwest Tropical today.</p></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-2" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">How do you maintain a bubble wall?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>Regularly clean the water and check the air pump and tubing to ensure smooth operation. Cleaning the surface and replacing water every few months will keep it in top shape.</p></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-3" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">What are the benefits of having a bubble wall?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>A bubble wall adds aesthetic appeal, promotes relaxation, and enhances the ambiance of any space, making it an ideal focal point. Contact Midwest Tropical to learn more about our bubble walls.</p></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-4" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">Can a bubble wall be customized for specific spaces?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>Yes, bubble walls can be tailored to fit various sizes, colors, and designs, ensuring they complement your space perfectly. Midwest Tropical offers custom bubble walls that complement your existing décor and seamlessly blend in to create a more vivid ambiance.</p></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-5" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">How do I choose the right bubble wall for my space?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>You should consider the size, design, and lighting options that best match your decor. Our team at Midwest Tropical can help guide you to the best choice based on your specific needs.</p></div></div></div>
 <script>
    const items = document.querySelectorAll(".accordion button");
function toggleAccordion() {
  const itemToggle = this.getAttribute('aria-expanded');
  for (i = 0; i < items.length; i++) {
    items[i].setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
  }
  if (itemToggle == 'false') {
    this.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
  }
}
items.forEach(item => item.addEventListener('click', toggleAccordion));
  </script> </div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-616907d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="616907d" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3f1710c" data-id="3f1710c" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a6a8a91 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="a6a8a91" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default"><h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Bubble Wall Gallery</h2></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b7bf473 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="b7bf473" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-808a4a6" data-id="808a4a6" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-10d9e28 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="10d9e28" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
